# Figma MCP fetch cache (scripts/figma-cache.mjs). It normally lives outside the
# repo, in %LOCALAPPDATA%/figma-mcp-cache, because Figma meters per seat and the
# sandbox project draws on the same daily budget. This entry covers the case
# where someone points FIGMA_CACHE_DIR back inside the tree: entries embed
# figma.com asset URLs that expire in ~7 days, so a committed cache would hand
# the next reader dead links.
.figma-cache/
